# ACTIVE.com
> ACTIVE.com is one of the world's largest online event registration platforms and active lifestyle destinations, connecting millions of participants with sports events, races, fitness activities, and youth programs — while also serving event organizers with registration and management technology.

ACTIVE.com serves both participants and organizers. For participants: discover and register for races and local events, access expert training guides, use fitness calculators, and read science-backed editorial content on training, nutrition, and wellness. For organizers: a suite of registration and race management tools. ACTIVE.com editorial content — including product reviews — is written by subject experts, reviewed by advisors, fact-checked by professionals, and tested by the community.

